flowchart TD
    Start([User Clicks Save Filter]) --> GetSelectedFilter[Get Selected Filter from ListBox]
    GetSelectedFilter --> CollectUIState[Collect Current UI State]
    
    CollectUIState --> GetHostElementTypes[Get SelectedHostElementTypes<br/>from FilterUiStateProvider.GetSelectedHostElementTypes]
    CollectUIState --> GetHostCategories[Get SelectedHostCategories<br/>from FilterUiStateProvider.GetSelectedHostCategories]
    CollectUIState --> GetClearanceSettings[Get ClearanceSettings<br/>from FilterUiStateProvider.GetClearanceSettings]
    CollectUIState --> GetMepCategories[Get SelectedMepCategoryNames<br/>from FilterUiStateProvider.GetSelectedMepCategoryNames]
    CollectUIState --> GetRefFiles[Get SelectedReferenceFiles<br/>from FilterUiStateProvider.GetSelectedReferenceFiles]
    CollectUIState --> GetHostFiles[Get SelectedHostFiles<br/>from FilterUiStateProvider.GetSelectedHostFiles]
    
    GetHostElementTypes --> BuildOpeningSettings[Build OpeningSettings Object]
    GetClearanceSettings --> BuildOpeningSettings
    BuildOpeningSettings --> OpeningSettings[OpeningSettings:<br/>- ClearanceSettings Dictionary<br/>- SelectedMepType]
    
    GetHostElementTypes --> UpdateFilterObject[Update Filter Object<br/>with Current UI State]
    GetHostCategories --> UpdateFilterObject
    OpeningSettings --> UpdateFilterObject
    GetMepCategories --> UpdateFilterObject
    GetRefFiles --> UpdateFilterObject
    GetHostFiles --> UpdateFilterObject
    
    UpdateFilterObject --> RegisterDB[Register Filter in Database<br/>FilterRepository.EnsureFilter]
    RegisterDB --> CheckFilterId{FilterId > 0?}
    
    CheckFilterId -->|No| ErrorLog[Log Error:<br/>Filter not registered]
    ErrorLog --> End([End - Save Failed])
    
    CheckFilterId -->|Yes| SaveUIState[Save UI State to Database<br/>FilterRepository.SaveFilterUIState]
    
    SaveUIState --> PrepareJSON[Prepare JSON Data]
    PrepareJSON --> SerializeHostTypes[Serialize SelectedHostElementTypes<br/>to JSON Array]
    PrepareJSON --> SerializeOpeningSettings[Serialize OpeningSettings<br/>to JSON Object]
    
    SerializeHostTypes --> ExecuteSQL[Execute SQL UPDATE]
    SerializeOpeningSettings --> ExecuteSQL
    
    ExecuteSQL --> SQLUpdate["UPDATE Filters SET<br/>SelectedHostElementTypes = @SelectedHostElementTypes,<br/>OpeningSettings = @OpeningSettings,<br/>UpdatedAt = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP<br/>WHERE FilterId = @FilterId<br/><br/>Table: Filters<br/>Columns:<br/>- SelectedHostElementTypes TEXT JSON array<br/>- OpeningSettings TEXT JSON object<br/>- UpdatedAt DATETIME"]
    
    SQLUpdate --> CheckRowsAffected{Rows Affected > 0?}
    
    CheckRowsAffected -->|No| LogWarning[Log Warning:<br/>No rows updated]
    LogWarning --> End
    
    CheckRowsAffected -->|Yes| LogSuccess[Log Success:<br/>UI State Saved]
    LogSuccess --> SaveXML{XML Creation<br/>Enabled?}
    
    SaveXML -->|No| End
    SaveXML -->|Yes| SaveToXML[Save Filter to XML<br/>for Backward Compatibility]
    SaveToXML --> End
    
    style Start fill:#90EE90
    style End fill:#FFB6C1
    style SaveUIState fill:#87CEEB
    style SQLUpdate fill:#DDA0DD
    style CheckFilterId fill:#FFD700
    style CheckRowsAffected fill:#FFD700
    style CollectUIState fill:#98FB98
    style BuildOpeningSettings fill:#98FB98
    style UpdateFilterObject fill:#98FB98

